  "name": "egglog",
  "description": "A high-performance language and engine that unifies Datalog-style relational queries with equality saturation for advanced program analysis and optimization. It implements an efficient e-graph architecture powered by generic join algorithms and a custom virtual machine for executing rule-based transformations. The system supports extensible sorts, sophisticated term extraction, and programmable rule scheduling to facilitate complex program synthesis and compiler optimization tasks.",
